# ---------------------------------------------------------------- build output
# `target/` also holds the *generated* crate for each converted app (the
# scaffold, its `src/methods.rs`, the built .so and the intermediate APKs), so it
# reaches gigabytes. It is fully reproducible: `dex2rs -i <apk> ...` regenerates
# it. Note that `d2c/project/target` and any nested crate target are covered too.
target/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------- artifacts
# Nothing below is source: the input APK, the repacked APKs we produce, the
# generated project archive and the signature keystore are all outputs or local
# state. `app-release.apk` in particular is a third-party app binary and is not
# ours to publish.
*.apk
*.zip
*.so

# --------------------------------------------------------------- local keystore
# `keystore/debug.keystore` is the *working-directory default* that `dcc.cfg` and
# `SignatureConfig::default` point at. The key itself is embedded in the CLI
# (`dex2rs/assets/debug.keystore`, which must stay tracked), so a copy here is
# pure local state: drop your own key at the default path to override the embedded
# one, and it never gets committed. Root-level only, so the asset above is not
# caught by this rule.
/keystore/

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------- logs
*.log
trace.txt

# ------------------------------------------------------------- python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# ---------------------------------------------------- vendored reference d2c
# `d2c/` is a clone of the public reference compiler
# (https://github.com/Kirlif/d2c) kept for differential testing only: the
# converter itself is pure Rust and does not need it to build. It carries its own
# 35 MB .git and multi-megabyte jars, so it is not vendored here. Restore it with
#   git clone https://github.com/Kirlif/d2c d2c
d2c/

# ----------------------------------------------------------------- local state
.tmp/

# ------------------------------------------------------------- editor / OS
.DS_Store
*~
